# test_wubu_selfbuild -- stage-0 SELF-BUILD harness: the compiler reads a
# holyd-LANGUAGE source FILE from the repo (src/runtime/selfbuild/hello.hd,
# its own language, not C), compiles it through the program emitter, drops the
